  "about": "Apps for tests/compat/run.sh. Each is packaged only for Windows, macOS, one Linux package format or the Snap Store, and has no official Flathub build. source uses the recipe check types (github, redirect, html, json) plus url (a fixed link to the latest file) and snap (snap download). expect is runs, or refused when debpak should decline the app (system services). args are extra convert options; seconds is how long the app gets to start.",
